{"id":"n71253-1-8","stage":4,"title":"음질 · 音质","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71253-1-8-1","ko":"저기에 있는 영화관 어때?","zh":"那边的电影院怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기에","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기에","audio":"/audio/f93d780041b136d31a70.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"영화관","meaning":"电影院","explanation":"영화관：电影院。","readings":[{"term":"영화관","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14113","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화관","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"92cd07820110f1fb","term":"영화관","zh":"电影院","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3","entryId":"14113","definition":"配备放映电影的设施，并能够使公众欣赏电影的地方。","pronunciation":["영화관"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/cc3190b69c879fd4afdf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71253-1-8-2","ko":"영화관이 낡아서 소리가 잘 안 들렸어. 음질이 너무 나쁘더라고.","zh":"那家电影院很旧，声音听不清楚。音质实在太差了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"영화관이","meaning":"电影院","explanation":"영화관：电影院；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영화관","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14113","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화관이","audio":"/audio/73868eb70dbb76df68ab.mp3"}},{"text":"낡아서","meaning":"老旧，破旧","explanation":"낡다：老旧，破旧；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"낡다","audio":"/audio/294c650cb539ffd87149.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36846","senseId":"1","lemma":"낡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낡아서","audio":"/audio/51776397c240d56cf9f4.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"들렸어.","meaning":"听到，传来","explanation":"들리다：听到，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들리다","audio":"/audio/f5d8f68f409d3cd71df1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70783","senseId":"1","lemma":"들리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들렸어","audio":"/audio/b8185fb4d5005fbc5ce0.mp3"}},{"text":"음질이","meaning":"音质","explanation":"음질：音质；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"음질","audio":"/audio/37c86196aec0bc60d86a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71253","senseId":"1","lemma":"음질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음질이","audio":"/audio/c189a10d443d51917f70.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"나쁘더라고.","meaning":"糟糕，不好","explanation":"나쁘다：糟糕，不好；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나쁘다","audio":"/audio/b67c592bde724aa15bfa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26816","senseId":"2","lemma":"나쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나쁘더라고","audio":"/audio/c7e33969de6c74ef6df8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"92cd07820110f1fb","term":"영화관","zh":"电影院","audio":"/audio/92cd07820110f1fb867a.mp3","entryId":"14113","definition":"配备放映电影的设施，并能够使公众欣赏电影的地方。","pronunciation":["영화관"]},{"id":"294c650cb539ffd8","term":"낡다","zh":"老旧，破旧","audio":"/audio/294c650cb539ffd87149.mp3","entryId":"36846","definition":"由于东西使用时间长而又破又旧。","pronunciation":["낙따"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"7